 209:Middlewares/ST/STM32_WPAN/ble/core/ble_legacy.h ****  * @param Peer_Address Public Device Address or Random Device Address of the
 210:Middlewares/ST/STM32_WPAN/ble/core/ble_legacy.h ****  *        peer device
 211:Middlewares/ST/STM32_WPAN/ble/core/ble_legacy.h ****  * @return Value indicating success or error code.
 212:Middlewares/ST/STM32_WPAN/ble/core/ble_legacy.h ****  */
